pbps changes: restrict the architecture set to x86-64 and its compat ABIs;
remove connect, socketcall, ptrace, process_vm_readv, process_vm_writev,
pidfd_getfd and unshare from the allowlist; allow sendto/sendmsg/sendmmsg only
without MSG_FASTOPEN, which could otherwise initiate a connection. This file is a launch policy,
not a certification of a host or an engine.
